    english: SELECT MAP
  - label: "Nas\u0131l Oynan\u0131r Ba\u015Fl\u0131\u011F\u0131"
    turkish: NASIL OYNANIR
    english: HOW TO PLAY
  - label: "Nas\u0131l Oynan\u0131r A\xE7\u0131klamas\u0131"
    turkish: "<b><color=#FFC93C>KONTROLLER</color></b>\r\nAra\xE7 kendi gider. Sol
      yar\u0131ya dokun sola, sa\u011F yar\u0131ya dokun sa\u011Fa d\xF6nersin.\r\nParma\u011F\u0131n\u0131
      bas\u0131l\u0131 tuttu\u011Fun s\xFCrece d\xF6nmeye devam eder, b\u0131rak\u0131nca
      d\xFCzelir.\r\n\r\n<b><color=#FFC93C>AMA\xC7</color></b>\r\nPolisten ka\xE7\u0131p
      uzun dayan. Skorun s\xFCreyle artar.\r\nAranma y\u0131ld\u0131z\u0131n artt\u0131k\xE7a
      polisler \xE7o\u011Fal\u0131r ve h\u0131zlan\u0131r.\r\n\r\n<b><color=#FFC93C>KUTULAR</color></b>\r\nYoldaki
      kutular kalkan, h\u0131zlanma, tamir ve \u015Fok dalgas\u0131 verir.\r\nEtkileri
      k\u0131sa s\xFCrer, g\xF6rd\xFC\u011F\xFCn anda topla.\r\n\r\n<b><color=#FFC93C>KARTLAR</color></b>\r\nYak\u0131n\u0131nda
      par\xE7alanan polislerden deneyim kazan\u0131rs\u0131n.\r\nSeviye atlay\u0131nca
      se\xE7ti\u011Fin kart arac\u0131n\u0131 kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak g\xFC\xE7lendirir.\r\n\r\n<b><color=#FFC93C>ARA\xC7LAR</color></b>\r\nOyun
      ba\u015Flarken kullanaca\u011F\u0131n arac\u0131 se\xE7ersin.\r\nYeni ara\xE7lar
      en y\xFCksek skorun artt\u0131k\xE7a a\xE7\u0131l\u0131r."
    english: '<b><color=#FFC93C>CONTROLS</color></b>

      The car drives itself.
      Tap the left half to turn left, the right half to turn right.

      Hold
      your finger down to keep turning; let go to straighten out.

      

      <b><color=#FFC93C>GOAL</color></b>

      Escape
      the police and survive. Your score grows with time.

      As your wanted
      level rises, police get faster and more numerous.

      

      <b><color=#FFC93C>CRATES</color></b>

      Crates
      on the road give shields, speed boosts, repairs and shockwaves.

      Their
      effects are brief, so grab them as soon as you see them.

      

      <b><color=#FFC93C>CARDS</color></b>

      You
      earn experience from police wrecked near you.

      When you level up, the
      card you pick permanently upgrades your car.

      

      <b><color=#FFC93C>CARS</color></b>

      You
      choose which car to drive before the run starts.

      New cars unlock as
      your high score grows.'
